15. Test Player-Created Positions

Do not rely exclusively on the default starting position.

Hess allows players to create unusual configurations.

Therefore test:

edge Kings

edge Queens

unusual back-rank configurations

advanced pawns

swapped pieces

Jesters in unusual positions

unusual combinations of special pieces

positions resulting from many previous swaps


The test system should eventually be able to generate or construct many such positions.


