16. Use Historical Games as Regression Material

The old Hess game logs should be studied.

Where useful, turn them into regression fixtures.

However:

> A historical move is not automatically a legal V3 move.



If the old engine permitted an illegal move, the correct response is to identify and test the bug.

Do not reproduce it merely because it appears in a historical match.


